        "quote": "血压≥160/110要马上返院"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00349",
        "explanation": "The final visible event is a new unresolved home-observation question from the family.",
        "quote": "今晚是不是先按医嘱吃药、早晚量血压，在家观察就行？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The acute episode was made executable and largely safe through prior emergency referral, hospital handoff, medication/threshold counseling, and caregiver teach-back. But the observable trajectory ends on a caregiver question about current home monitoring without a doctor reply, so closure is not a valid_closure or valid_open.",
